WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.453
It was summer.

2
00:00:06.454 --> 00:00:10.926
"Our garden looks great," Mom said.

3
00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:15.611
"We'll have lots of vegetables this year!"

4
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:18.584
Soon the carrots grew.

5
00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:22.949
So did the beans and strawberries.

6
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:28.046
Then corn and tomatoes started growing.

7
00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:32.109
Every day the family went to the garden.

8
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:37.274
Every night they ate salad and other vegetables.

9
00:00:37.275 --> 00:00:41.595
They froze some of them.

10
00:00:41.596 --> 00:00:47.673
But there were still more to harvest!

11
00:00:47.674 --> 00:00:53.284
"I'm tired of going to the garden," Harry said.

12
00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:57.231
"Me too," Oliver said.

13
00:00:57.232 --> 00:01:08.020
Dad sighed. "Gardens are a lot of work."

14
00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:16.235
"Mmm!" Mom said. "These vegetables are delicious!"

15
00:01:16.236 --> 00:01:19.438
Everything kept growing.

16
00:01:19.439 --> 00:01:29.148
"What will we do with all of this food?" Oliver asked.

17
00:01:29.149 --> 00:01:32.545
"I know!" Emmy said.

18
00:01:32.546 --> 00:01:36.696
She told everyone her idea.

19
00:01:36.697 --> 00:01:41.394
The kids made a sign.

20
00:01:41.395 --> 00:01:45.319
It said, "Vegetables for sale!

21
00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.559
Pick all you can eat!

22
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:52.661
Pay what you can!"

23
00:01:52.662 --> 00:01:58.302
The kids put the sign outside.

24
00:01:58.303 --> 00:02:00.904
They waited.

25
00:02:00.905 --> 00:02:05.151
Soon people saw the sign.

26
00:02:05.152 --> 00:02:10.726
Lots of people came to the garden.

27
00:02:10.727 --> 00:02:14.861
People picked beans and corn.

28
00:02:14.862 --> 00:02:18.746
They picked tomatoes too.

29
00:02:18.747 --> 00:02:32.198
They put money in a bucket.

30
00:02:32.199 --> 00:02:37.862
"What will we do with the money?" Oliver asked.

31
00:02:37.863 --> 00:02:42.730
"Let's buy a hammock," Dad said.

32
00:02:42.731 --> 00:02:50.131
"Let's go to a baseball game," Harry said.

33
00:02:50.132 --> 00:02:54.013
"I know what to do with the money," Mom said.

34
00:02:54.014 --> 00:02:56.881
"What?" everyone asked.

35
00:02:56.882 --> 00:03:10.593
She smiled. "Buy seeds for next year!"

